  "tips": [
    "Drop-in for the original HMC5883L \u2014 but different register layout. Many cheap 'HMC5883L' modules are actually QMC.",
    "Calibrate for hard-iron (offset) and soft-iron (scale) distortion \u2014 uncalibrated heading is useless.",
    "Tilt-compensate using accelerometer data for a usable compass on a tilted board."
